Sewa mein, Thana Prabhari, Cyber Cell, Mumbai
Vishay: Online thagi ki shikayat

Main Amit Shah, pita ka naam Kishore Shah, Andheri West Mumbai ka nivasi hoon. Dinank 5/4/2026 ko mujhe OLX par bike bechne ke naam par ek vyakti ne phone kiya, number +91 70 4455 6677. Usne kaha ki wo Army mein hai aur advance ke liye PhonePe QR scan karne ko kaha. Maine UPI ID armyjawan.raj@ybl par Rs. 25,000 bheje aur phir 15000 aur bheje. Dono transaction 5 April 2026 ko hue. Uska bank account SBI mein hai A/C No. 3456 7812 9087 IFSC SBIN0004321. Ab wo phone nahi utha raha. Mera aadhaar 3456 7890 1238 hai.
Kripya FIR darj karein.
Amit Shah
